      "x": 60,
      "y": 620,
      "width": 1950,
      "height": 22,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "text": "frontend never uses those host ports — inside the network it calls  http://backend:8000  directly.  Drop  ports:  from backend and the app still works;\nyou just lose the /docs page in your browser.",
